Analyzer simplifyrange
A range of the form:
for x, _ = range v {...}
will be simplified to:

for x = range v {...}
A range of the form:

for _ = range v {...}
will be simplified to:

for range v {...}
This is one of the simplifications that "gofmt -s" applies.
